          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "<pre>\n[2232/2233] Building CXX object ui/qt/CMakeFiles/qtui.dir/widgets/qcustomplot.cpp.o\n../ui/qt/widgets/qcustomplot.cpp:34900:40: warning: implicit conversion loses integer precision: 'long' to 'int' [-Wshorten-64-to-32]\n      int pointIndex = closestDataPoint-mDataContainer->constBegin();\n          ~~~~~~~~~~   ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n1 warning generated.\n</pre>",
